   "widgets_values": [
    "## 1 \u00b7 Your inputs\n**Mesh:** type the path into **UltraTex Load Mesh**: a full path like `C:\\models\\volt.glb` or a path relative to `ComfyUI/input`. GLB, OBJ and PLY work. Trellis2, Pixal3D, Hunyuan or your own sculpt are all fine.\n\n**Reference image:** one front view of the object. Best: the exact image you generated the mesh from, so it lines up.\n\n**Background:** you don't need a transparent PNG. **BiRefNet** cuts the object out and Prep is set to `mask_meaning = foreground`. If you would rather use your PNG's alpha: connect Load Image **MASK** to Prep `reference_mask` instead and set `mask_meaning = background (LoadImage)`.\n\n**Text and logos** only come out clean if they are sharp and readable in the reference, ideally on the front."
   ],
   "title": "Read me \u00b7 Inputs",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
