   "widgets_values": [
    "## 2 \u00b7 Models\nNothing to change here after running the installer.\n\n- The two **UltraTex Load LoRA** nodes are required. The stock *Load LoRA* node can't read these files and fails **silently**.\n- First run, check the console for **both** LoRAs:\n  `UltraTex LoRA ... (peft format): N layers patched of N`\n- The prompt stays **empty**. UltraTex only listens to the image.\n- No negative prompt is connected on purpose: with an empty prompt, CFG would only double the render time."
   ],
   "title": "Read me \u00b7 Models",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
