   "widgets_values": [
    "## 3 \u00b7 Prep\nNormalizes the mesh, unwraps UVs and renders the 6 normal views.\n\n- `uv_mode`: **comfy_gpu** (~6 s for 500k faces). **keep_existing** if your mesh already has clean UVs, e.g. from Blender or Maya. **xatlas** is CPU-only and slow (minutes).\n- **Quick check:** the *Reference check* preview should show your object filling the mesh silhouette **edge to edge**. If it's small or shifted, the mask is wrong."
   ],
   "title": "Read me \u00b7 Prep",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
